rs/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced in `4.8.dev`[6ef60dc], `4.6.stable`.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (6ef60dc27) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (2560x1600 @ 165.00 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1088) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSetting `FileDialog.visible` to `true` repeatedly (with `use_native_dialog = true`) creates multiple native dialogs, instead of refocusing the already opened native dialog.\n\nTest script:\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\n@export var file_dialog: FileDialog # Set use_native_dialog = true .\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tfile_dialog.visible = true\n\tfile_dialog.visible = true\n```\n\nVideo:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e92da3d6-4253-44d6-b4dc-ef49aa089fc5\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a FileDialog node to the scene tree and set `use_native_dialog = true`.\n2. Add a script to set `visible = true` multiple times.\n3. Notice that multiple native dialogs are created when the script runs.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_FileDialog_Visible_True.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31821015/MRP_FileDialog_Visible_True.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123167/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}